  "content_html": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;<img border=\"0\" src=\"/assets/images/content/418f56abc640a0f997.png\" style=\"text-align: center;\" /></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><h2 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc; font-family: arial;\">🕯️ מעט מן האור</span></h2><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אָרוּר מַסִּיג גְּבוּל<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְאָמַר, הַכֹּל שֶׁלִּי.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אָרוּר מַרְחִיב זְבוּל<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְאָמַר, שֶׁלְּךָ שֶׁלִּי.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וּמַשְׁגֶּה,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וּמַטֶּה,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וּמַקְלֶה,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וּמַכֶּה.</span></p><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">📘 עצה שבועית</span></h2><p></p><span data-end=\"167\" data-start=\"145\"><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span data-end=\"167\" data-start=\"145\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אל תאמר \"שלך שלי\".</span></span></div></span><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">הדרך הקלה לקחת - היא הדרך המהירה לאבד.<br />מי שמרחיב את גבולו על חשבון הזולת - מצמצם את נפשו שלו.</span></span></p><p></p><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">🌀 הצד השני של המטבע</span></h2><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc; font-family: arial;\"></span></p><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><div>גְּבוּל הִסַּגְתָּ</div><div>מְאוּם לֹא הִשַּׂגְתָּ</div></span></div><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">💎 פנינה</span></h2><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span face=\"Arial, sans-serif\">\"כַּאֲשֶׁר יִדְאֶה הַנָּשֶׁר\" = 1096 =&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color: white; text-align: -webkit-center;\">\"</span><span style=\"background-color: white; text-align: -webkit-center;\">וְאֵלֶּה תּוֹלְדֹת יִצְחָק\"<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span>⬇️&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;⬇️<br />רומי (רמב\"ן ורלב\"ג)&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span style=\"background-color: white; text-align: -webkit-center;\">עשו הוא אדום (בראשית לו)</span></span></p><p style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span face=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><br /></span></p><h2 style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.3em; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 242, 204); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">📘 מילון ארמי־עברי</span></h2><p style=\"background: 0px 0px white; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 0px 25px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">חמש מילים מארמית שבתורה - עם פענוח והארה לשונית.</i></span></p><p style=\"background: 0px 0px white; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 0px 25px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"></p><p style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span face=\"Arial, sans-serif\"></span></p><ol style=\"box-sizing: border-box; counter-reset: templateify 0; margin: 10px 0px; padding: 0px 20px 0px 0px;\"><li style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span><span style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span>'</span><span><i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"font-style: normal;\"><b>עֲמָלֵנוּ</b></span></i>' / '</span><span><i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"font-style: normal;\"><b>לֵיאוּתַנָא</b></span></i>'</span><br /></span></span><span>❖&nbsp;<i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"font-style: normal;\">טורח, יגיעה -&nbsp;</span></i></span><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span>לֵאוּת</span></span></span></li><li style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span><span style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">'<i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"font-style: normal;\"><b>לַחֲצֵנוּ</b></span></i>' / '<i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"font-style: normal;\"><b>דֻחְקַנָא</b></span></i>'<br /></span></span><span style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">❖</span>&nbsp;<i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"font-style: normal;\">מקום או מצב צר - דחוק</span></i></span></li><li style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span>'<i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"font-style: normal;\"><b>הַשְׁקִיפָה</b></span></i>' / '<i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"font-style: normal;\"><b>אִסְתַּכִי</b></span></i>'<br /></span>❖ מביט, רואה, סוֹכֶה - זכוכית (סכוכית בחילוף ז-ס)</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span><span style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><span>'<i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"font-style: normal;\"><b>בַּאֵר</b></span></i>' / '<i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"font-style: normal;\"><b>פָּרֵישׁ</b></span></i>'</span></span><br /></span></span><span style=\"background: 0px 0px white; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">❖</span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">&nbsp;</span><i style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"font-style: normal;\">מבואר, מבורר - מפורש</span></i></span></li><li style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span>'<i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"font-style: normal;\"><b>מִשְׁאַרְתֶּךָ</b></span></i>' / '<i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"font-style: normal;\"><b>אָצוּתָךְ</b></span></i>'<br /></span>❖ מערכת כיכרות, פס ייצור - אַצְוָה</span></li></ol><div style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></div><h2 style=\"display: inline; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\"><br /></span></h2><h2 style=\"display: inline; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\"><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"></span></div>👁️ מבט חד</span><br /></h2><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: right;\"><a href=\"/assets/images/content/bc2063741cebd4942f.png\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"226\" data-original-width=\"392\" height=\"115\" src=\"/assets/images/content/bc2063741cebd4942f.png\" width=\"200\" /></a></div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span style=\"font-family: arial;\">משיג או מסיג גבול?</span></span></div></div>"
